pired  and reflect and remind myself to be  mindful to be more loving and to be just  grateful for everything I have  so this is currently my daily devotional  book that I will be reading through this  year it's really short it's only you  know five minutes of devotion and  meditation every morning but it will  make a huge difference in the way you  live your life and the way you look at  things and the way you approach things  as well so I would recommend you to get  a daily devotion book it doesn't have to  be religious being mindful isn't about  religion being mindful is being aware of  your thoughts your emotions and your  action and once you learn to be more  mindful every day you will start to see  the changes and  in your life in a positive way the next  on my list is I want to continue to  improve on a strength and flexibility  and to remind myself and you guys to  have fun when I do my workouts ok and  next is I want to start to explore where  who is for the past year I felt really  really unsettled I decided to come back  to Malaysia because I feel the need to  be closer with my family and it is the  best decision that I've ever made but at  the same time I don't really feel  settled here I at this point in my life  I have to be honest I do not know where  home is so I want to keep exploring that  and keep that option open well then  that's on my list which is number 19 is  I hope to meet someone nice well at this  point in my life I am single there is  nothing wrong with being single it won't  be nice to meet someone nice someone  that I can talk to someone that I can  really have a deep conversation with and  some of the shares are the same value as  I do so you know what it is important to  write down what you want and then if s  it because that way the universe has its  way to bring it to you so I thought I  want to add it into my list and the  final thing on my list is to remember to  always give thanks in the morning and  ask myself at the end of the day what is  the highlight of my day no matter how  bad your day is if you take the moment  to reflect on the positive aspect in  your life you will start to have a shift  in your mind and things would just be  better so guys if you do not yet have a  list I  recommend you to take the time and write  down your list it is not difficult do  not think or overthink on what you want  to write down just take the time and  write down whatever that comes first to  your mind because those other things  that you really want to work on and want  to accomplish and I believe that when  you write down and you don't commit  yourself to this list you are more  likely to attract these things that you  want in your life and move towards the  direction that you want in your life  okay so let me know what's on your list  for 2016 and at the end of this year  when you look back at your list you will  find that you have accomplished a lot of  things on this list because you first  started by manifesting what you want  having this platform for me to reach out  to each and every one of you is the best  gift that I've received and I know that  this is my calling and I want to  continue to do that so you know I just  want to say how grateful I am for your  continuous love and support for what I  do and I hope that the way I live my  life will be will continue to be an  inspiration to you and you know in  return you will inspire others to live a  more healthy happier and balanced life  and this is what I want my channel to be  and this is what I want my life to be  thank you
 

